The average of 5 numbers is 24. If one of the numbers, 32, is removed, what will be the average of the remaining 4 numbers?
A) 20
B) 21
C) 22
D) 23
Solution : 
         a+b+c+d+e/5 =24
         total=120
    remove one value 
         120-32=88
         average=88/4
                = 22

Answer : C
